[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5411066196","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122789#issuecomment-5411066196","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122789","id":5411066196,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQoZRVA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T13:26:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T13:26:33Z","body":"What I meant by suppressing in my comment on the issue was actually just applying one of our warning suppression macros e.g. `GODOT_GCC_WARNING_IGNORE`.\r\n\r\nWarnings are meant to help us, but if they do get in the way there is no need to jump through hoops for them. In this case I see no reason to switching to a dedicated heap allocation. The VM code ensures that the lifetime of this pointer does not exceed the lifetime of the stack allocated call level, it's just a bit too complicated for the compiler to recognize.\r\n\r\nThere might be a point against relying on such complicated contracts, but for the GDScript VM I think it's worth it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5411066196/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5418313440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122789#issuecomment-5418313440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122789","id":5418313440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQvTm4A","user":{"login":"Rafael-Petry","id":69591645,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTkxNjQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69591645?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry","html_url":"https://github.com/Rafael-Petry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T23:24:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T23:24:26Z","body":"I must've missed the existence of these macros while looking through the codebase, this is definitely a more reasonable approach.\r\n\r\nJust fixed my changes accordingly. Thanks for the tip!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5418313440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5420484012","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122789#issuecomment-5420484012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122789","id":5420484012,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQxYFrA","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T04:13:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T04:13:51Z","body":"Maybe runners use older GCC, so that's why it errors? Not fully sure. The error from CI checks:\r\n```\r\n ./core/typedefs.h:310:37: error: unknown option after '#pragma GCC diagnostic' kind [-Werror=pragmas]\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think you can try to see if\r\n```C++\r\n\tGDScriptLanguage::CallLevel call_level;\r\n\tGDScriptLanguage::CallLevel* call_level_ptr = &call_level; // Suppress -Wdangling-pointer GCC warning.\r\n\tGDScriptLanguage::get_singleton()->enter_function(call_level_ptr, p_instance, this, stack, &ip, &line);\r\n```\r\nwill also suppress it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5420484012/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5432192083","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122789#issuecomment-5432192083","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122789","id":5432192083,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQ8isUw","user":{"login":"Rafael-Petry","id":69591645,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTkxNjQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69591645?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry","html_url":"https://github.com/Rafael-Petry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rafael-Petry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T23:14:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T23:14:18Z","body":"I tested your idea and it didn't work unfortunately, it raised the initial dangling pointer warning.\r\n\r\nYou were correct on the version mismatch of the runner though. The build-linux job runs on ubuntu-22.04, which uses <ins>gcc-11</ins> by default. The `-Wdangling-pointer` warning was introduced on <ins>gcc-12</ins> (as stated on the _GCC Warning History_ wiki), which explains why the runner fails to recognize it. I also confirmed this is true by compiling on the different versions locally.\r\n\r\nTherefore, I think the way to go would be to just check if the GCC version >= 12 before using the suppressing macros, such as:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#if defined(__GNUC__) && !defined(__clang__) && __GNUC__ >= 12\r\n\t\tGODOT_GCC_WARNING_PUSH_AND_IGNORE(\"-Wdangling-pointer\") // The VM ensures call_level is not freed while it is in use, so this warning is a false positive for GCC 12+.\r\n#endif\r\n\r\n\t\t_call_stack = call_level;\r\n\r\n#if defined(__GNUC__) && !defined(__clang__) && __GNUC__ >= 12\r\n\t\tGODOT_GCC_WARNING_POP\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf that is a good approach, for what I could see, it both fixes the warning issue when compiling with more recent versions of GCC and also doesn't break compilation for older versions.\r\n\r\nThanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5432192083/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5818943251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122789#issuecomment-5818943251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122789","id":5818943251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWtYHEw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T17:29:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T17:29:09Z","body":"Thanks! Congratulations on your first merged contribution! 🎉 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5818943251/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]